  "Knowledge_Tooltip": "<sprite=\"SurvivalGuide_Sprites\" sprite name=\"knowledge\"> Knowledge is gained when a Drifter gains experience. Happier drifters gain more experience.",
  "LABEL_GAMEOVER_SLEEPINGWITHFISHES": "Sleeping with the fishes",
  "LABEL_MENU_DAILYREPORTS_TITLE": "Daily Reports",
  "LABEL_OVERLAYS_NOOVERLAY": "No Overlay",
  "LANDMARK_CityParkingGarage_Description": "In another time, they left their precious little cars here. Tucked safely behind fences while their drivers enjoyed some me-time in the city.",
  "LANDMARK_CityParkingGarage_Name": "Parking Garage",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandPotatoes_Description": "Back when the land turned sour, potatoes were the last crop still kicking. Now, weeds smother the fields, creeping over a last few forgotten spuds.",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandPotatoes_Name": "Overgrown Potato Fields",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandRuins_Description": "This place was already abandoned long before the flood rolled in. Wrecked barns, rusty tools... still clinging to a time where the soil could provide.",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandRuins_Name": "Farm Ruins",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandTractors_Description": "The fields are bare, but the old machines still offer a harvest of their own.",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandTractors_Name": "Derelict Farming Gear",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandWindmill_Description": "This windmill once harvested the wind while farmers harvested the earth. Now it stands broken, a retired worker staring at a soggy field.",
  "LANDMARK_FarmlandWindmill_Name": "Weathered Windmill",
  "LANDMARK_HardwareStore_Description": "The shelves sag under the weight of mass-produced wrenches, hammers, and screwdrivers, each crafted just well enough to get the job done… once.",
  "LANDMARK_HardwareStore_Name": "Hardware Store",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_AluminumWarehouse_Description": "Stacks of aluminum hoarded in a frenzy before the great flood. Everyone wanted a slice of the metal that could keep the government out of their thoughts.",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_AluminumWarehouse_Name": "Aluminum Warehouse",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_ChemicalFactory_Name": "Chemical Factory",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Drifter_Description": "Using the machines’ dying warmth and whatever the conveyor belts yielded, they somehow survived the overwhelming smog.",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Drifter_Name": "Factory Camp",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Factory_Plastic_Description": "Inside these factories, plastic flowed like a river, shaping treasures that now color the ocean.",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Factory_Plastic_Name": "Plastic Factory",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_OilSilos_Description": "A cluster of empty silos, nearly drained of every drop. By the time the shortage hit, people had turned the world’s black gold into mountains of disposable forks.",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_OilSilos_Name": "Oil Silos",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Scout_Description": "A chimney so tall it pierced the clouds, tainting a whole new layer of the atmosphere.",
  "LANDMARK_Industry_Scout_Name": "Smokestack",
  "LANDMARK_PollutedWoods_ElectricityPylon_Description": "Once carrying power between cities, it now looms over the grove as a reminder of the air that choked these woods. Its frame still makes a fine perch for spotting what lies beyond.",
  "LANDMARK_PollutedWoods_ElectricityPylon_Name": "Electricity Pylon",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_AbandonedFactory_Name": "Abandoned Factory",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Aquaculturist_Description": "Some of these fish twist and grow in ways the world never intended.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Aquaculturist_Name": "Nettie's Fish Farms",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Astronaut_CrashSite_Description": "Scorched metal, smoke still rising, pieces scattered across the crater. The rocket crashed HARD. Its passenger and the Fusion Core might still be inside!",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Astronaut_CrashSite_Name": "Crash Site",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Birdkeeper_Rescue_Description": "This penthouse was built to be untouchable. And yet, seagulls sit in the pool like they own the place.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Birdkeeper_Rescue_Name": "Penthouse Fortress",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Botanist_PlantGrove_Description": "The plants move like waves, dancing, vibing... Hypnotic. Strange. Alive.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Botanist_PlantGrove_Name": "Plant Grove",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Cathedral_Description": "The wall was perfect to keep out one wave. but the next one brought friends...",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Cathedral_Name": "Mystic-Llama Cathedral",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Chef_FancyRestaurant_Description": "This restaurant was abandoned only recently, its kitchen full of half-finished experiments with strange, polluted fish.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Chef_FancyRestaurant_Name": "Six Star Restaurant",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Chemist_Rescue_Description": "The lab hit a blackout. leaving the bubbling research suspended in a messy limbo.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Chemist_Rescue_Name": "Research Laboratory",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Electrician_Rescue_Description": "The plant is practically vibrating! Sparks fly from every pipe! Abandon at once, the eels rule this place now.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Electrician_Rescue_Name": "Eel-Infested Power Plant",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Engineer_Rescue_Description": "Amid stacks of crunched cars, a lone figure welded a robot from car and van parts.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Engineer_Rescue_Name": "The Rust Bucket",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Farmer_Rescue_Description": "Still standing, this farmhouse radiates a quiet, stubborn comfort.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Farmer_Rescue_Name": "Farmhouse",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Farmer_Terraformer_Description": "Panels smashed, vents stuffed with pitchforks, wires everywhere. Someone went completely feral on this machine. It's dead, and so is the land.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Farmer_Terraformer_Name": "Agriculture Unit Delta",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_FishbaitShop_Description": "Lucky for the worms, this bait shop was built just above the floodline.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_FishbaitShop_Name": "Fish Bait Shack",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Hospital_Description": "Soggy beds, murky white halls, and symptoms too weird to understand.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_Hospital_Name": "Desolate Hospital",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_RadioStation_Description": "It reads: <i>\"Raw! Unfiltered! Interviewing one piece of trash at a time!\"</i>",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_RadioStation_Name": "Local Radio Station",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_RadioTower_Name": "Broadcasting Tower",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_ResearchFacility_Name": "Big Harma Research Facility",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_RuinedLighthouse_Name": "Ruined Lighthouse",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_SecretMilitaryBunker_Name": "Secret Military Bunker",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_SewagePlant_Description": "The pipes reek, the water is foul, yet the Holy Mackerel enjoys every stinking second.",
  "LANDMARK_Quest_SewagePlant_Name": "Sewage Treatment Plant",
